mode: "100644"
text: "# Keyword research, surfaces + two worked examples\n\n## Keyword-research method (the agent advises; IG search is native)\n```\n1. Top-Reel scan: search your topic in IG; read the captions + on-screen text of the top 5 Reels. Recurring phrases = high-value keywords.\n2. Competitor Name fields: if 4/5 use \"| Business Coach\", that's a high-volume term -- add it.\n3. Google \"People Also Ask\": Google indexes IG, so PAA questions (\"how do I...\") become caption phrases.\n-> Build a CLUSTER of 3-5 related terms (primary + supporting). NEVER fabricate a volume.\n```\n\n## Surface map (publishable vs native vs other-tools)\n| Surface | Keyword | Who sets it |\n|---|---|---|\n| Caption (first sentence first) | primary + cluster, long-tail | **WoopSocial (content.text)** |\n| Hashtags (3-5 labels, in caption) | niche topic tags | **WoopSocial (in content.text)** |\n| Name field (display name) | \"Name \\| Niche\" | native (advised) |\n| Handle / username | keyword-relevant | native (advised) |\n| Bio | niche + offer + location + CTA | native (advised) |\n| Alt text | descriptive, matches caption | native / at-post (advised) |\n| On-screen Reel text | the keyword overlay | image/video tool |\n| First-3-sec spoken audio | the keyword out loud | creator / reels-script |\n| Category + location | niche category, place tag | native |\n| Auto-captions | (toggle on) | native |\n\n## Search-first caption template\n```\n[Primary keyword as the first sentence -- what someone would search] . Then the value, with 1-2 supporting\ncluster terms woven in naturally over 150-300 words. No stuffing. End: CTA. Then 3-5 niche hashtags.\ne.g. \"Easy vegan dinner in 10 minutes -- this high-protein chickpea bowl...\" (not \"POV: you're starving lol\")\n```\n\n## Must-match checklist (Computer Vision cross-checks)\n```\n[ ] Caption topic == what's visually on screen (a \"salad\" caption on a \"cake\" video tanks ranking)\n[ ] Alt text describes the actual image + includes the keyword\n[ ] On-screen text + first-3-sec spoken keyword reinforce the same topic\n[ ] Auto-captions ON; no other-platform watermark\n```\n\n## WoopSocial publish block\n```\nplatform: INSTAGRAM | postType: POST | REEL | STORY | content.text: the search-first caption + 3-5 hashtags\n(REEL: optional cover). Validate via platform-specs-and-validation. Profile/alt text/category/auto-captions are native.\n```\n\n## Worked example 1 - local coffee shop (blunt indie-founder voice)\n```\nCLUSTER from top-Reel scan: \"best coffee shop austin\", \"austin specialty coffee\", \"where to work austin\". CAPTION opens\n\"Best specialty coffee shop in Austin for remote work --\". Name field \"Brew | Austin Coffee\" (I advise; owner sets it).\nAlt text matches the latte photo. WoopSocial publishes the caption + 4 niche tags. No stuffing, no #coffeelover spam.\n```\n\n## Worked example 2 - fitness creator Reel (warm studio voice)\n```\nReel on 10-min mobility. First 3 seconds I say \"ten minute morning mobility routine\" out loud; same as the on-screen text\nand the caption's first line -- so Computer Vision sees a match. reels-script handles the script; the overlay -> an image tool.\nAuto-captions on, TikTok watermark removed. WoopSocial publishes the caption; I advise the bio + alt text. Watch saves + watch-time.\n```\n\nBoth: keyword cluster from real queries (no fabricated volume); search-first caption (publishable); profile labels +\nalt text + on-screen/spoken keyword that MATCH; WoopSocial publishes the caption, the rest native/advised/other-tools.\n"
